  "definition": "Initial License Application Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-10-03",
  "historyNote": "#4073, eff 6-26-86, EXPIRED: 6-26 New. #5630, eff 5-26-93; ss by #7006, INTERIM, eff 5-26-99, EXPIRED: 9-23-99 New. #9466, eff 5-2-09; ss by #12167, INTERIM, eff 4-29-17, EXPIRED: 10-26-17 New. #12640, eff 10-3-18",
